    "title": "A. Large files in parts",
    "body": "A 2 GB video sent in one piece must start again from zero if the connection breaks near the end. With a **multipart upload**, the phone sends 20 parts of 100 MB, several at a time; a failed part is sent again alone, so a break costs at most 100 MB. When all parts have arrived, storage joins them into one object. Downloads of popular files are served through a **CDN** (SD 3).",
